{"title":"히스토리에","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=bDsRlO/hAHIkfYnFY/2MA8KjrJfrkEKx4AzSOGh0&filename=th3","synopsis":"에우메네스는 역사상 이름이 높은 여러 전장- 그 현장에 있었다.\n그리고 분명 수많은 작전에도 참가했을 것이다.\n그렇다면 어째서 왕이나 다른 장수와 함께 이름이 남아있지 않은 것일까.\n그것은 그가 '기록하는 쪽'의 사람이었기 때문이 아닐까.\n…그러던 어느 날, 그는 기록하는 일을 그만둔다.\n그때부터 기록자는 '기록당하는 쪽'이 되어 역사의 무대에 그 모습을 드러낸 것이다.\n\n[HISTORIE] ⓒHitoshi Iwaaki/Kodansha.Ltd.","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":290,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":206,"change":{"type":"up","amount":84}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":199,"change":{"type":"up","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-09-11","rank":251,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-15","rank":258,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-25","rank":286,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-06","rank":206,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-10","rank":296,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-26","rank":298,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-27","rank":253,"change":{"type":"up","amount":45}}],"weekly":[{"date":"2026-10-10","rank":293,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-11","rank":297,"change":{"type":"down","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-10-12","rank":298,"change":{"type":"down","amount":1}}],"monthly":[]},"viewSeries":[],"metricsSeries":[{"date":"2026-10-11","v":586028,"rc":2336,"rs":23302,"cc":631},{"date":"2026-10-12","v":586030,"rc":2336,"rs":23302,"cc":631},{"date":"2026-10-13","v":586050,"rc":2336,"rs":23302,"cc":631},{"date":"2026-10-14","v":586057,"rc":2336,"rs":23302,"cc":631},{"date":"2026-10-15","v":586095,"rc":2336,"rs":23302,"cc":631},{"date":"2026-10-16","v":586098,"rc":2336,"rs":23302,"cc":631},{"date":"2026-10-17","v":586109,"rc":2336,"rs":23302,"cc":631},{"date":"2026-10-18","v":586173,"rc":2336,"rs":23302,"cc":631},{"date":"2026-10-19","v":586253,"rc":2336,"rs":23302,"cc":6